     "titulo": "Surveys and spending",
     "texto": [
      "**anket** = survey; **tüketici** = consumer; **yüzde** = percentage.",
      "To summarise data, use **çoğunlukla** («mostly») or **yarısı** («half»).",
      "**-e göre** means «according to»: **ankete göre** = according to the survey."
     ],
